<title>UK: BNG sets $300 million Eurobond due 2000.</title>
<headline>BNG sets $300 million Eurobond due 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    12.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.02    PAY DATE    12.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.833    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
